**Discount schedule.** The tenure labor discount on the after-hours remote amount of a ClearPath Managed IT Services ticket counts the whole months from the agreement's go-live date to today:
- 24 or more months take 5.0 percent off;
- 12 up to 23 months take 2.5 percent off;
- fewer months take nothing off.

A whole month between two dates is counted only once the later date reaches the same day of the month as the earlier one, and a month window of N months ending today takes the entries dated fewer than N whole months before today.

**Hypothetical cases.** Go-live 2024-05-31: on 2025-05-30 the agreement has 11 whole months and takes nothing off; on 2025-05-31 it has 12 and takes 2.5 percent off; on 2026-05-31 it has 24 and takes 5.0 percent off.
